 (ns seon.sci.forgive
   "The forgiving input stage in front of the one reader.
 
+  A model reply that holds a Markdown fence is read as Markdown first
+  (`fenced`): only its Clojure fences are code, every other line a `;`
+  comment, and inside them every form is code (`:fenced`). A reply without a
+  fence is read as Clojure with prose forgiven (`:reply`).
+
